Subject: [PATCH] Patch 0165 (temporary test tool): screen jump. On the map,
 SELECT + R2 walks the tamer into the next new screen of the disc (SCRN.DAT)
 and SELECT + L2 into the previous one, wrapping, arriving at exit 0 by a
 warp's fade (findNewScreen in mod_screen.c remembers the empty ids); the
 roster switch keeps SELECT + L1/R1

